      "message": "This method is not going to be called by the `BrokerApiPluginListener` [1] because Gerrit invokes `plugin.stop()` before `PluginGuiceEnvironment.onStopPlugin()`, and the DynamicItem registration has already been removed.\n\nI have tested this the calling condition is `false`:\n\n```\nplugin.getName().equals(brokerApiDynamicItem().getPluginName())\n```\n\nBecause `brokerApiDynamicItem().getPluginName()` returns `null`.\n\n[1] https://gerrit.googlesource.com/modules/events-broker/+/refs/heads/master/src/main/java/com/gerritforge/gerrit/eventbroker/BrokerApiPluginListener.java#57",
