      "message": "An idea would be to cache the latest provider plugin name in the `WebSessionBrokerApiLoadedListener`, not the _current_ bound instance, WDYT?\n\nSomething like:\n\n```\nprivate @Nullable String activeBrokerPlugin;\n\n@Override\npublic synchronized void onBrokerApiStarted() {\n  activeBrokerPlugin \u003d brokerApiDynamicItem().getPluginName();\n  ...\n}\n\n@Override\npublic synchronized void onStopPlugin(Plugin plugin) {\n  if (plugin.getName().equals(activeBrokerPlugin)) {\n    onBrokerApiStopped();\n  }\n}\n```\n\nOr do you think Gerrit should notify stop listeners _before_ `plugin.stop(env)` removes dynamic registrations?",
